Data attribution
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
This license covers the source code only. The underlying datasets retain
their own terms of use and must be cited accordingly:

  - VIIRS DNB nighttime lights — NOAA/NASA, via Google Earth Engine.
  - ACLED (Armed Conflict Location & Event Data) — https://acleddata.com,
    free for non-commercial / academic use with attribution.
  - World Bank Open Data — CC BY 4.0.
  - Country boundaries (GeoJSON) — per the upstream provider's license.
